<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2844_11169.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Von gottes gnaden, <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Julius Friderich</persName>
<lb n="2"/>herzog zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-167" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Wuerttemberg</placeName> undt <placeName resp="#ner">Teckh</placeName>,
<lb n="3"/>grave zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-245" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Muemppelgarth</placeName>, herr
<lb n="4"/>zue <placeName resp="#ner">Haydenhaimb</placeName>. Vormundt, undt
<lb n="5"/>Administrator.
<lb n="6"/>Unßern guenstigen grueß zuevor, erßame
<lb n="7"/>weyße, liebe beßondere, Waß an unß
<lb n="8"/>unßer vormundtsunderthon <persName resp="#ner">Hanß
<lb n="9"/>Schauber</persName>, burger undt handelsman
<lb n="10"/>zue <placeName resp="#ner">Calw</placeName>, von wegen <persName resp="#ner">Caspar Schlum-
<lb n="11"/>pff</persName>, euwers angehoerigen zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St.
<lb n="12"/>Gallen</placeName>, ihme Schaubern, umb naher
<lb n="13"/>undt nahr, fuer 200. f. uffgeborg-
<lb n="14"/>ter waaren, noch der zeit hinder-
<lb n="15"/>stelliger schuldt, supplicando un-
<lb n="16"/>derthonig gelangen laßen: das habt
<lb n="17"/>ihr auß dem Inschluß beygefuegter
<lb n="18"/>seiner underthonig supplon mitt
<lb n="19"/>mehrerm zuevernemen.
<lb n="20"/>Ob nun wohl uns, wie es mit sein <persName resp="#ner">Schau</persName>-
<lb n="21"/>bers angeregter pretendirter schuldt-
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2844_11170.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">forderung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschaffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnwissendt</unclear>.
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dieweil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wür</unclear> aber nit zweifflen
<lb n="24"/>dann daß er Schauber solche gnueg-
<lb n="25"/>samb werde bescheinen könden,
<lb n="26"/>darzue er in Unserm Vormundts
<lb n="27"/>herzogthumb, wie gemeldt, ver-
<lb n="28"/>bürgert, undt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">es</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> der-
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">faellen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermög</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vormundts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtrechtens</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allen</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gerichten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestalten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herkomen</unclear>,
<lb n="32"/>daß einem jeden creditori, nach
<lb n="33"/>dem er sein angegeben creditum
<lb n="34"/>mit beglaubten instrumenten,
<lb n="35"/>oder documenten darthuett,
<lb n="36"/>auch sein praerogativ vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andern</unclear>
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorbehalten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">assignirt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">württ</unclear>:
<lb n="38"/>Als haben Wür dem gebettnen
<lb n="39"/>willfahr halb umb sovihl desto
<lb n="40"/>weniger bedenkhens getragen, in-
<lb n="41"/>massen hiemitt Unser gl. gesinnen
<lb n="42"/>an euch, Ir wöllen mehr bemeldtem
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2844_11171.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schoelberg</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeregts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weib</unclear>, inn
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jehnigen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seine</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnuegsambe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liquidation</unclear>, von rechts
<lb n="46"/>undt billicheit weg, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebueren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mage</unclear>
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dermassen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhuelfflich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erscheinen</unclear>,
<lb n="48"/>daß er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnaden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ertheilter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorschrifft</unclear>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuerckhlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genossen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuehab</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wahr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fin</unclear>-
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear>.
<lb n="52"/>Das seyen wir umb euch, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderwerts</unclear>
<lb n="53"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">g</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willen</unclear>, damit wir euch
<lb n="54"/>ohne das wohl geneigt, zuerkennen
<lb n="55"/>erbiethig. Datum <origPlace resp="#ner">Ruetj</origPlace>, den
<lb n="56"/><origDate when="1631-03-22" resp="#ner">22. Martj ao. 1631</origDate>.
